# .gitignore for the Hal project
#
# Goal: commit ONLY the tool itself (scripts, slash-commands, docs). Your personal
# "second brain" and any local/secret state stay out of git.
#
# Tracked on purpose:  hal, setup.sh, *.sh, claude-commands/, *.md docs, .gitignore
# Ignored below:       your Vault, Claude Code local state, secrets, caches, OS cruft.

# ---- Your second brain — personal notes, NEVER commit ----------------------
/Vault/

# ---- Claude Code local state for this folder (session transcripts, settings) -
/.claude/

# ---- Local Hal config & secrets --------------------------------------------
# hal.conf records the setup profile chosen for THIS machine (24gb/12gb/cloud) and
# is generated by setup.sh — it's a local choice, not part of the project.
/hal.conf
/.config/
/.local/
*.key
*.pem
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---- Import staging & extraction caches (if ever created outside /Vault/) ---
_Import-Staging/
.pdf-text/
.docx-text/
.pptx-text/
.html-text/

# ---- Local semantic index (RAG vectors); rebuildable, never commit ----------
.rag/
System/.rag/

# ---- OS / editor cruft ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---- Python / Node scratch (in case you test scripts in this folder) --------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
env/
node_modules/

# ---- Logs & temp ------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.out
/hal.conf.bak.*
